WEBVTT

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:04.450
This is the City of Steam, Whitechurch.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.620
There's a coal mine beneath us,

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:10.350
so this is a merchants' city filled with 
people who tried to get rich off coal.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:20.820
This is where there was a sighting of a man
we believe to be Cain Madhouse.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.850
He's killing the citizens 
of this city night after night,

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:29.330
and it appears that over half of the 
attacks have occurred in this area.

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.820
I wonder what he's after.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.640
First, we need to get more information on him.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:35.250
Right.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.220
I've got nothing to tell the military!

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.080
They refuse to deal with us,

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:54.490
let alone talk to us as soon as we 
say we're with the military.

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:56.620
Well, considering where we are...

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:59.470
Slums like this have been around forever,

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:02.070
but they've gotten worse since the war.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.590
Some people have to do 
whatever it takes to survive.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.580
Crimes occur here every single day.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:10.000
Let's continue our investigation.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.150
Why not rest a little?

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.060
Oh, hey! I know this great 
little restaurant downtown!

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:24.270
Well, he's been looking for him for a while, 
so I can't blame him.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:02.030
Gargoyle's Judgment

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:12.460
Um... Liza said she was going 
to the police station.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:16.010
She wanted to confirm if there 
have been any more victims.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:21.890
Um... May I ask you something?

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:26.250
About what you said before, was that—

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:10.400
Oh, I was just...

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:13.760
I'm sorry for doing this without permission.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:15.900
Go ahead and continue.

00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:23.740
I'm really good at sewing.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:26.400
My father ran an orphanage,

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:29.670
and I would often sew and 
mend the children's clothes.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:32.610
I grew up in an orphanage, too.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.990
I didn't really fit in, though.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:40.170
I bet you were a child who didn't cause much 
trouble and could do everything on your own.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.050
I wouldn't say that.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:46.380
I was pretty unreliable and caused 
trouble for everyone around me.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:51.350
I can't even imagine you 
being unreliable, Hank.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.450
Sorry, Elaine.

00:04:58.450 --> 00:04:59.940
It's okay, Hank.

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:03.680
I love sewing your clothes.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.150
Here you go. It's all done.

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:15.530
You have blue eyes.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.760
I knew someone with 
blue eyes just like yours.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:24.620
Would that be... someone named Elaine?

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:26.480
How did you know?

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:31.130
You were having a nightmare 
once and said her name...

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:35.240
She died...

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.430
She was killed by Cain.

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:45.600
All Incarnates will eventually lose their souls.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.960
Elaine felt responsible as 
the one who created them

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.870
and tried to make things right.

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:52.410
But...

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:57.460
Cain killed Elaine and released 
the Incarnates into the world.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:58.820
I don't know what he hopes to do.

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:03.470
At any moment, they can lose their 
sanity and attack innocent people.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:07.760
Before that happens... 
Before they become Beasts...

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.700
I must slay them while they're still human.

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:14.170
That's my final duty as the 
Incarnate squad captain.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:18.820
Are you planning to do this all on your own?

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:27.560
Get up! There's been another victim!

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:33.740
They found her this morning.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:38.410
Liza, does this victim fit the other crimes?

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:41.750
Yes. Her wounds are similar 
to those on the others.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:45.300
<i>Parallel claw marks...</i>

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:48.410
<i>No, Cain didn't do this.</i>

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:49.350
<i>This is...</i>

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:51.370
I know who did it!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:54.090
That demon statue killed her!

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:57.320
You again, Andy? Go beg 
for money somewhere else!

00:06:57.320 --> 00:07:00.350
I'm telling the truth!
 Why won't you believe me?!

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:03.990
Did you see him?

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:06.130
Well?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:10.480
He went in there.

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:13.360
It's an old church that 
no one goes to anymore.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:15.460
Are you sure it's an Incarnate?

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:19.550
The Incarnate Gargoyle. His name is Topher.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:21.910
Christopher Keynes.

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:25.220
He had a stronger sense of 
justice than anyone I'd known.

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:27.870
I've had enough...

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:32.170
I don't want to kill anyone
 or see anyone get killed anymore!

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.350
Shut your mouth, Theo!

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:36.270
They are blinded by greed 
and destroy the land!

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:38.460
The Southern army is an unforgivable evil!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:43.110
It's our mission as Incarnates 
to strike down these invaders!

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:45.950
We, the North, are on the side of justice!

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:51.240
Those powerful words from Topher 
always kept our spirits up.

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:55.690
Hey... You're going to kill him, right?

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:00.580
Looks like you have your 
reasons to hold a grudge.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:04.000
Why don't you discuss them with me?

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:11.810
Wha?!

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.540
You stupid little brat! Get back here!

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:20.130
Liza! They're completely visible!

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:23.250
I'll go look for him.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:25.020
There's just something about him...

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:27.170
Be careful.

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:30.480
Don't worry. If anything happens, 
I have this with me.

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:32.400
Can you fire it?

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.570
This isn't like the incident with me.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:38.820
Can you shoot someone you don't hate?

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.280
I'll be fine.

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:49.340
You're so awkward, you know that?

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:52.440
Not that I dislike that about you.

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:56.540
It's about time.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:59.670
I have to leave town for a while, 
due to orders from the military.

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:02.210
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:03.060
All right.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:07.900
I finally found you.

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:09.600
Andy.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:15.530
Do you live close by?

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:19.580
Won't your family be worried 
if you don't head home soon?

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:24.690
And what about you?

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:25.440
Huh?

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:28.630
They're with the military, aren't they? 
How could you hang around them?

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:32.070
That's not normal! Didn't your 
parents teach you anything?

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:34.540
Well, they're gone now, so...

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:42.100
My father... was an Incarnate.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.010
What?!

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:47.010
And he was killed... by Hank.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:49.540
Then you should want to get revenge!

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:52.880
Of course. At first, I hated him.

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:56.100
No... I might still feel that way now.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:59.830
But more than that,

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:03.010
I wanted to know why my father had to die.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:08.050
I decided to follow Hank 
around to find that answer.

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:14.620
No one is just evil.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:20.080
They all had their own conflicts 
and suffering... and feelings.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:23.130
The more I found out about the Incarnates,

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:25.880
the more I realized
 they're not gods or Beasts...

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:29.090
I believe they're human, more than anything.

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:39.700
Hey!

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:49.700
My mother was killed by the Gargoyle, too.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:53.460
Of course, she did some bad 
things in order to survive...

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:57.540
But it's messed up that 
she had to die like that!

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:00.130
He's no human...

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.380
He's just a Beast.

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.130
I saw the crime you just committed, boy.

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:09.800
Repent.

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:11.490
The time of judgment is upon you.

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:14.020
You shall pay for your 
crimes with your life.

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:15.730
That's him!

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:18.630
You would protect that criminal?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.980
Why do you kill people?

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:24.500
I am punishing them, as well as saving them.

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:28.510
I am freeing those soiled by sin.

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:33.090
All Incarnates will eventually 
lose their souls.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:38.590
I know you aren't doing this 
because you truly want to!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:42.300
Don't let your powers as an 
Incarnate take over your soul!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.370
Hank!

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:18.010
Captain. You've come to kill me, haven't you?

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:19.620
That's right.

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:22.060
That makes you a sinner, as well.

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:25.180
I'll wait for you in the church. 
Go there whenever you please.

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:36.120
I'm sorry... I...

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:37.700
Don't worry about it.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:40.570
This is my job.

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:56.800
This city has always been filthy.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.670
Then make it all disappear.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:07.730
You have the strength to make that 
happen now, don't you, Christopher?

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:11.790
Cain, my answer will not change, no matter 
how many times you come to see me.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:14.420
I will continue to see 
justice served in this city.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:17.960
So callous... But I guess 
I should expect that from you.

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:21.410
I actually came here for 
a different reason today.

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:28.730
That's a special bullet that can 
rob an Incarnate of their powers.

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:32.080
It can even take their life, 
depending on how it's used.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:36.820
Well, then... I'll see you 
again once justice is served.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:43.950
Schaal, you stay here.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:50.930
If I don't return by dawn, 
leave this city immediately.

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:54.050
Hey.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:56.610
Why didn't you shoot him?

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:59.270
Do you feel sorry for them?

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:24.310
Welcome, Captain Hank!

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:26.170
I wanted to show you this!

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:28.560
To show you the justice I've served!

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.670
Topher!

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:34.570
A statue?

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:43.910
It's not like you to step into 
enemy territory with no plan.

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:49.320
Do you feel sorry for them?

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:54.710
No. I...

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:01.240
My rifle is gone?

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:04.930
Oh, no... Andy!

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:18.470
Good! Now, come!

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:23.060
That's right! Struggle!

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:26.230
The more evil tries to spread, 
the more justice shall prevail!

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:28.310
You have no justice, Topher!

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:31.190
No, Captain... Justice
 is definitely here with me!

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.380
Just like during the war...

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.840
I was meant for war.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:42.530
I had what it takes to 
survive on the battlefield.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:45.680
I would strike down the invaders,
 and peace would come.

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:48.790
That was true justice.

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:50.960
A cease-fire? Peace?

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:52.290
You can't be serious!

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:55.920
The villains from the 
South are still breathing!

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:58.180
You just want to let them go free?

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:01.170
Wasn't this fight for the sake of justice?!

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:05.680
The battle ended before 
we could exact true justice.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:10.580
So why... Why did my body end up like this?

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.370
Answer me, Captain!

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:32.820
You lose.

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:49.400
I see... It's very effective.

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:53.110
A Godkiller bullet?

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:56.210
Now, it's time for your judgment.

00:16:56.210 --> 00:17:01.230
Have you ever actually thought 
about what we Incarnates are?

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:08.000
These unique bodies were 
our mission, as well as our trial.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.040
By accepting them and persevering,

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:12.620
we can become beings 
more powerful than humans.

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:15.410
The moment we throw away our humanity...

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:19.160
we turn into Beasts.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:25.100
No one will call your name anymore, Topher!

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:29.240
This place never changes.

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.450
Nothing has changed since before the war.

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:35.240
And that's exactly why...

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.420
the justice I seek should be here.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.820
You stole that, didn't you?

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:45.220
You run from your crime because 
you don't understand justice.

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:48.570
If you don't understand it,
 I shall teach you.

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:50.850
There's no reason to be afraid.

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:54.100
I just want to talk about justice.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:00.880
Oh? So you decided to show up, boy?

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:05.380
This is for my mother!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:09.360
Living is suffering, isn't it?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.760
I'll free you from that suffering!

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:19.180
Andy!

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:22.180
Get up, Andy!

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:23.960
You showed up, as well?

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:26.510
Schaal...

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:28.490
I understand...

00:18:28.490 --> 00:18:30.490
your hearts.

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:36.130
You commit crimes in order to survive, and you 
feel less guilty with every crime you commit.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:38.200
It must have been so painful...

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:45.150
Stay away from me, you monster!

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:51.870
I see...

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:57.400
So this is the justice I must bring forth...

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:09.900
The age of misfortune, with no one
 to see justice done, has come to an end.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:13.180
I shall be the one to bring 
death upon those who suffer

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:15.660
from the sins they committed, and save them.

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:17.800
Please stop this, Christopher!

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:21.640
No... I am Gargoyle.

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:26.180
Now... I shall free you both 
from your suffering, as well.

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:58.400
Captain... You have no... justice.

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:03.760
Yeah... I know that, Topher.

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:09.520
I am... justice...

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.030
It's over now?

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:20.920
Yeah.

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.770
Why are Incarnates...

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.600
Why do you all...

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.270
end up like this?

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:33.150
Our power...

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:37.220
was just too great for one person to have.

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:40.380
Hank!

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:42.750
Huh?

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:46.760
Yes, our power is great.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.800
So great that anything we desire is possible...

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:52.860
Ca—

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:55.440
Cain!

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:58.340
It's been a while, Hank.

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:02.940
How did it feel to get shot 
by a Godkiller bullet again?

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:06.760
That was a little gift from me
to commemorate our reunion.

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:09.330
So it <i>was</i> you!

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.270
Hank!

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:14.620
Don't struggle too much. You might just 
wound that beautiful skin of yours.

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:18.670
Let's have you take a little nap.

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.560
Elizabeth...

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:25.800
Now, then... I came here 
to give you an invitation.

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:30.810
The location is written on the card.

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:34.570
If you promise to show up, 
I'll give her back to you.

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:38.550
I'll be waiting for you at 
the party tomorrow night.

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:40.720
Cain...

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:24.330
It's almost time, Cain!

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:28.900
Thank you for coming to my evening soirée!

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:30.590
You have blue eyes, too!

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:32.940
They appear to have been 
attacked by some animal.

00:23:32.100 --> 00:23:34.770
You've been traveling with 
the captain, haven't you?

00:23:34.020 --> 00:23:35.920
Prepare for battle immediately!

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:40.050
The King of the Beasts

00:23:37.520 --> 00:23:38.740
Cain...
